Bad Wither No Cookie - Reloaded for Horizon
A port of Bad Wither No Cookie - Reloaded to Horizon (Minecraft: Java Edition
26.3 rewritten in Rust) as a native mod.

Bad Wither No Cookie - Reloaded
Originally created by droidicus; by Kreezxil, with Eleksploded, Mrbysco,
PrincessStellar, Valentin Alarcon and others
https://gitlab.com/kreezxil/BadWitherNoCookie (branch 1.21.1, 3.20.4)
Licensed under the MIT License (LICENSE: the licence file of its 1.18.1-Fabric
branch, "Copyright (c) 2021 droidicus, Kreezxil, Eleksploded"; its later
branches name MIT in their mod metadata).

The icon in mixins/bwncr/data/icon.png is the mod's own logo
(common/src/main/resources/logo.png). The English texts are the mod's own
(en_us.json and its messages); the Russian ones were translated for this port,
as the mod has no ru_ru.json.

The config screen the mod builds with AutoConfig and Cloth Config follows
Cloth Config by shedaniel (https://github.com/shedaniel/cloth-config,
LGPL-3.0), rewritten in Rust (mixins/bwncr/cloth.rs); its arrows and buttons
in mixins/bwncr/cloth_sprites.rs are parts of Cloth Config's texture
(assets/cloth-config2/textures/gui/cloth_config.png), converted to rows of
pixels, and its texts are Cloth Config's own.

This port, by DispatchedToHeaven, rewrites the mod's sound
handler, config and listen command in Rust for Horizon's native mod API. It is not affiliated with Kreezxil, Mojang or
Microsoft.

Those Cloth Config parts (cloth.rs, cloth_sprites.rs) are under the GNU Lesser General Public License
v3.0: see LICENSE.LGPL-3.0 and LICENSE.GPL-3.0. The rest of the port is under the MIT License (LICENSE).
